        "sha": "91915d6354952f89fbf91d967e0711a7a890ed2a",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/git/trees/91915d6354952f89fbf91d967e0711a7a890ed2a"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 91915d6354952f89fbf91d967e0711a7a890ed2a\nparent 1c088b64867d63f489d9d2ec58219e21f28357dd\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792237735 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793743646 +0100\n\nellswift: declassify PRNG outputs before branching on them\n\nThe header says secp256k1_ellswift_create is constant time in seckey32\nand auxrnd32, but secp256k1_ellswift_xswiftec_inv_var branches on the\nbranch value and on u, which are SHA256 outputs of both. ctime_tests\ndid not catch this because it never marked auxrnd32 secret.\n\nDeclassify the branch pool and u32 right after they are drawn. They\nare hash outputs, so they do not reveal the secret inputs. Then mark\nauxrnd32 secret in ctime_tests.\n\nFixes #1962.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRJ5SMZs3eEinN+Lb4iedqLwmlHIAUCaupbHhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQInnai8JpRyDDlAEA1NvlZkCKIkkRXp9yvT4H\ncYO8zkG7F5D8v5MzC7LnpWUBAMT7BsVOEsa3U7giGxlqjdW+GXgQ01WA9f84Mn0o\nbnIJ\n=d+JJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
